    Repair activation delayed native-session binding in knowledge budget
    
    Poll for native-session/meter binding outside the accounting flock for at most
    one monitor interval or 20 seconds, bounded by the creation-anchored wall cap.
    Full cap liability is retained while reserved; do_start_locked still rechecks
    identity and meter under the lock and holds/stops if unknown. Add delayed,
    missing and unmetered regression cases to the isolated host-cpu lifecycle smoke.
    No hash-bound Act34 file, config, permit or cap changed; no live dispatch.

